{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>英國核心通脹數據符合市場預期。</p><p></p><p>英國國家統計局公布，9月消費物價指數(CPI)按年上升百分之3.5，按月升百分之0.4，兩個數據都較市場預期高0.1個百分點。</p><p></p><p>扣除能源、食品和煙酒的核心消費物價指數，按年升百分之2.8，按月升百分之0.2，兩個數據都符合市場預期。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T15:22:07.515577+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T19:37:47.657441+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T15:17:47.994433+00:00","content_hash":"68e141ba4f38d9ba190fbe77a366466f48caa751bfb8fa9b7e2a831e00189634","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}